1.0. The WSD Model {#s1a}
------------------

The WSD model is an extension to the Bidirectional RNN (BRNN) model [@b7] originally proposed for speech recognition. The model is similar to the Bidirectional GRU (BGRU) model [@b9], except that the output of the GRU cell is a single vector. The output is then further processed by a series of layers which form a chain. We will refer to this chain as the word prediction chain. The model architecture is shown in [Fig. 2](#f2){ref-type="fig"}

